TITLE Mix 50 mM DIC + 50 mM Ca (1:1), heat 20 to 200 C in 10 steps, equilibrate with calcite

SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp      20
    units     mmol/kgw
    pH        7 charge
    C(4)      50

SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp      20
    units     mmol/kgw
    pH        7 charge
    Ca        50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 1

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat_calcite.sel
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -temperature true
    -totals Ca C(4)

USER_PUNCH
    -headings Temp_C Density_kg_L
    10 PUNCH TC, RHO

END
